{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00787","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周郊祀乐章 治顺乐 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周郊祀乐章 治顺乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽卫离丹阙，金轩赴泰坛。\n珠旗明月色，玉佩晓霜寒。\n黼黻龙衣备，琮璜宝器完。\n百神将受职，宗社保长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}